00:12:59.910 --> 00:13:02.170
I'd still like to keep him here

293
00:12:59.910 --> 00:13:02.170
for observation.

294
00:13:02.940 --> 00:13:04.380
So. in theory.

295
00:13:05.180 --> 00:13:07.810
your implants

296
00:13:05.180 --> 00:13:07.810
might re-align peptide bonds

297
00:13:07.880 --> 00:13:09.980
