306
00:13:58.070 --> 00:13:59.590
Life signs?

307
00:14:01.600 --> 00:14:03.400
No readings.

308
00:14:03.470 --> 00:14:05.340
Nothing's in here.

309
00:14:10.350 --> 00:14:11.970
Let's sweep the area.

310
00:14:12.050 --> 00:14:14.680
Be alert for any surprises

311
00:14:12.050 --> 00:14:14.680
