322
00:14:46.150 --> 00:14:47.740
They wiped their data banks.

323
00:14:47.820 --> 00:14:49.650
Luck runs out fast. Cadet.

324
00:14:49.720 --> 00:14:51.190
Next time. be more careful.

325
00:14:52.320 --> 00:14:54.650
Crash site is secure. Lieutenant Spock.

326
00:14:58.760 --> 00:15:00.420
Looks like they beamed out.

327
00:15:02.900 --> 00:15:06.060
The technology here is consistent

328
00:15:02.900 --> 00:15:06.060
