370
00:17:27.580 --> 00:17:30.140
- See why I couldn't stay away?

371
00:17:31.650 --> 00:17:33.510
I need to add something to the agenda.

372
00:17:33.580 --> 00:17:35.020
Please bring in the guards.

373
00:17:39.350 --> 00:17:41.650
Ready to shake the tree

374
00:17:39.350 --> 00:17:41.650
