375
00:17:41.720 --> 00:17:42.880
Am I.

376
00:17:44.090 --> 00:17:45.420
Here we go.

377
00:17:54.140 --> 00:17:55.360
Elder Gamal.

378
00:17:56.240 --> 00:17:57.760
