379
00:18:10.320 --> 00:18:11.650
Do you recognize this?

380
00:18:13.520 --> 00:18:14.580
No.

381
00:18:16.390 --> 00:18:19.690
My analysis indicates

382
00:18:16.390 --> 00:18:19.690
it is a kind of neural dampener.

383
00:18:19.760 --> 00:18:22.390
designed to reduce

384
00:18:19.760 --> 00:18:22.390
