385
00:18:22.460 --> 00:18:24.190
We found it in the wreckage of the ship.

386
00:18:25.870 --> 00:18:27.600
As I said. I've never seen this.

387
00:18:28.370 --> 00:18:29.530
Based on its size.

388
00:18:29.600 --> 00:18:31.570
logic suggests your attackers

389
00:18:29.600 --> 00:18:31.570
