391
00:18:33.370 --> 00:18:34.470
Can I see it?

392
00:18:36.010 --> 00:18:37.410
I'd rather you didn't.

393
00:18:41.420 --> 00:18:44.850
- You must be the science officer.

394
00:18:41.420 --> 00:18:44.850
- I am.

395
00:18:44.920 --> 00:18:46.480
Do you know the speed of propagation

396
00:18:46.550 --> 00:18:49.580
