398
00:18:54.630 --> 00:18:58.290
I believe it is roughly

399
00:18:54.630 --> 00:18:58.290
52.000 times the speed of light.

400
00:18:58.370 --> 00:19:01.630
Really? Wow. That's super slow.

401
00:19:02.040 --> 00:19:04.230
No wonder you have to use

402
00:19:02.040 --> 00:19:04.230
