452
00:22:01.180 --> 00:22:03.210
Long live the First Servant.

453
00:22:20.300 --> 00:22:22.290
Careful. Cadet. Remember to chew.

454
00:22:23.670 --> 00:22:26.610
Oh. right. you're on rotation

455
00:22:23.670 --> 00:22:26.610
