506
00:24:30.660 --> 00:24:32.290
I'm okay. Chris. really.

507
00:24:33.200 --> 00:24:34.530
I just...

508
00:24:36.040 --> 00:24:38.670
I knew him. Kier.

509
00:24:38.740 --> 00:24:41.400
- For years.

510
00:24:38.740 --> 00:24:41.400
- He would've killed you.

511
00:24:42.840 --> 00:24:45.070
- He almost did.

512
00:24:42.840 --> 00:24:45.070
