524
00:25:50.580 --> 00:25:52.840
I have a confession to make.

525
00:25:52.910 --> 00:25:54.850
That first time we met...

526
00:25:56.080 --> 00:25:57.920
I may have been hitting on you.

527
00:25:58.620 --> 00:26:00.140
- just a little.

528
00:26:01.520 --> 00:26:03.350
Oh. you definitely were.

529
00:26:09.130 --> 00:26:10.430
Got to admit...

530
00:26:12.200 --> 00:26:14.360
