534
00:26:25.050 --> 00:26:26.510
Yeah. me too.

535
00:26:28.450 --> 00:26:29.940
I thought...

536
00:26:31.520 --> 00:26:33.850
"I wonder what ever happened

537
00:26:31.520 --> 00:26:33.850
to that Majalan girl

538
00:26:33.950 --> 00:26:35.450
"who couldn't fly a shuttle."

539
00:26:35.960 --> 00:26:37.820
- Stop it.

540
00:26:39.060 --> 00:26:41.120
I knew how to fly it.

541
00:26:41.200 --> 00:26:44.060
Yeah. I just flew it

542
00:26:41.200 --> 00:26:44.060
