543
00:26:48.970 --> 00:26:50.960
I don't know. I felt like...

544
00:26:52.110 --> 00:26:54.580
we recognized something in each other.

545
00:26:56.140 --> 00:26:59.240
It was a shame that we never got

546
00:26:56.140 --> 00:26:59.240
