547
00:26:59.310 --> 00:27:01.410
Was I wrong?

548
00:27:01.480 --> 00:27:03.820
- I mean. I wasn't expecting this.

549
00:27:01.480 --> 00:27:03.820
- Mmm.

550
00:27:06.120 --> 00:27:08.680
But it's rare to know

551
00:27:06.120 --> 00:27:08.680
