552
00:27:09.320 --> 00:27:11.220
Yeah. it is rare.

553
00:27:14.660 --> 00:27:16.690
Some of us get a glimpse. though.

554
00:27:17.630 --> 00:27:19.220
What do you mean?

555
00:27:19.770 --> 00:27:20.760
Um...

556
00:27:22.700 --> 00:27:24.300
In ten years.

557
00:27:25.840 --> 00:27:27.870
