565
00:27:49.130 --> 00:27:51.390
- Only...

566
00:27:49.130 --> 00:27:51.390
- Only?

567
00:27:52.200 --> 00:27:53.260
Only you'd

568
00:27:54.200 --> 00:27:56.230
