571
00:28:01.180 --> 00:28:04.810
Science. service. sacrifice?

572
00:28:10.320 --> 00:28:12.910
That future is still very far away.

573
00:28:14.050 --> 00:28:17.150
- Sorry. I've overstepped.

574
00:28:14.050 --> 00:28:17.150
- Mmm. no. you didn't.

575
00:28:18.360 --> 00:28:19.880
Thank you for telling me.

576
00:28:19.960 --> 00:28:22.120
You'd be welcome here. It's just...

577
00:28:25.470 --> 00:28:27.700
another part of the future to consider.

578
00:28:38.050 --> 00:28:39.840
You called. Cadet?

579
00:28:39.910 --> 00:28:42.510
You asked for a needle in a haystack.

580
00:28:39.910 --> 00:28:42.510
and I found it.

581
00:28:42.580 --> 00:28:43.780
I translated their dialect

